  ('Geographical mobility of labour', 'the ease with which workers can move between different locations for work.', 'A Level macroeconomics'),
  ('Occupational mobility of labour', 'the ease with which workers can move between different jobs/occupations.', 'A Level macroeconomics'),
  ('Money', 'anything generally accepted as a medium of exchange; functions include medium of exchange, unit of account, store of value and standard for deferred payment.', 'A Level macroeconomics'),
